WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.052 --> 00:00:00.885
(audience cheering)

00:00:00.885 --> 00:00:02.450
- All right, we've got an
incredible feel good story

00:00:02.450 --> 00:00:03.690
to close out this hour.

00:00:03.690 --> 00:00:04.872
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:04.872 --> 00:00:07.780
(cheerful upbeat music)
(audience cheering)

00:00:07.780 --> 00:00:09.810
About a week ago, a
Florida woman was driving

00:00:09.810 --> 00:00:12.330
on a busy road when she
had a medical incident

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:15.640
and passed out behind
the wheel, super scary.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:19.440
Amazingly her coworker, Janet,
who was also in a nearby car,

00:00:19.440 --> 00:00:22.870
saw what was going on
and sprung into action.

00:00:22.870 --> 00:00:25.210
As you can see, she got
on foot racing through

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.890
the bustling intersection
and waving her arms

00:00:27.890 --> 00:00:29.760
to get other drivers' attention.

00:00:29.760 --> 00:00:32.070
Soon, strangers were
getting out of their cars

00:00:32.070 --> 00:00:34.150
to stop the moving vehicle.

00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:35.810
It's amazing how many people came together

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:38.250
to protect this woman and
everyone else around them.

00:00:38.250 --> 00:00:41.150
We have Janet and her coworker,
Lori, on the line right now.

00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:44.630
So they're watching on
WP TV West Palm Beach.

00:00:44.630 --> 00:00:47.391
What's up, y'all?
(audience cheering)

00:00:47.391 --> 00:00:50.430
- Hi, Kelly. (chuckles)
- Hi.

00:00:50.430 --> 00:00:53.020
Lori, first of all, I'm glad
to see that you're all right.

00:00:53.020 --> 00:00:56.033
You feeling good?
- Thank you, I feel great.

00:00:56.033 --> 00:00:58.380
- I've never seen anything
like that on video.

00:00:58.380 --> 00:00:59.820
I was like, "Wait, what?"

00:00:59.820 --> 00:01:02.740
So Janet it's lucky that
you saw what was going on.

00:01:02.740 --> 00:01:04.743
So tell us what you remember.

00:01:04.743 --> 00:01:09.743
- We worked together and we
never could be in the same role

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:13.860
in the same time and this time we did.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:17.580
And when I saw her hitting the sidewalk

00:01:18.860 --> 00:01:23.590
she went to the second
lane and then I see her

00:01:23.590 --> 00:01:26.060
going that way and I'm like,
"Something's wrong with her."

00:01:26.060 --> 00:01:30.500
And then I'm like, "Oh, this isn't her."

00:01:30.500 --> 00:01:33.770
So I went and I parked my
car and I start running,

00:01:33.770 --> 00:01:36.500
banging the window to
see if she would respond,

00:01:36.500 --> 00:01:38.400
but she didn't respond at the minute.

00:01:38.400 --> 00:01:40.987
But then I'm waving my
hands and I am saying

00:01:40.987 --> 00:01:44.570
"Help, help, help" and
then more people came over

00:01:44.570 --> 00:01:46.292
and tried to help me.

00:01:46.292 --> 00:01:49.410
- Oh my gosh, it's the craziest footage.

00:01:49.410 --> 00:01:51.210
And it's so amazing how
everyone came together.

00:01:51.210 --> 00:01:53.390
But Janet, Lori, you've since met

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:55.970
with some of the other
good Samaritans, right?

00:01:55.970 --> 00:01:57.680
- Oh yes. That was wonderful.

00:01:57.680 --> 00:02:01.260
They had a nice celebration
at the police department

00:02:01.260 --> 00:02:03.900
and we all got together
and it was just wonderful

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:07.500
to see everyone and to get to know them.

00:02:07.500 --> 00:02:08.990
We're all gonna have dinner

00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:12.270
and we're gonna get together again.

00:02:12.270 --> 00:02:15.440
It was just wonderful
to meet all these people

00:02:15.440 --> 00:02:17.500
and to say thank you to them all.

00:02:17.500 --> 00:02:20.060
- Absolutely. Well,
thank you so much, Janet.

00:02:20.060 --> 00:02:21.040
Thank you so much, Lori.

00:02:21.040 --> 00:02:22.850
I'm liking your post right now, right?

00:02:22.850 --> 00:02:26.210
(audience cheering)
And that's not all.

00:02:26.210 --> 00:02:27.820
Our season long partner Pilot Pen,

00:02:27.820 --> 00:02:29.630
makers of Friction, the go to erasable pen

00:02:29.630 --> 00:02:32.040
of "The Kelly Clarkson Show,"
they think Janet's actions

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:33.220
were as fearless as we do.

00:02:33.220 --> 00:02:36.374
So Janet, they're gonna give
you $1000 just for being rad.

00:02:36.374 --> 00:02:39.057
(audience cheering)
(Kelly laughing)

00:02:39.057 --> 00:02:40.160
- Thank you.

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:45.160
- [Kelly] Absolutely. All
right, thank you guys so much.

